      <data key="d2">cb-0395</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHARITABLE GALA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Charitable Gala is a social event where Anthony and Veronica were co-hosts, displaying their public affection and comfort with each other."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0395</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MOONLIT STROLL&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A Moonlit Stroll is the romantic encounter where Charles played the violin for Anthony along the Seine."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0395</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DISTINGUISHED LINEAGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Distinguished Lineage refers to the heritage and legacy of the Brown and Stevens families, both known for their contributions in various fields."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0395</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC SERVICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public Service is a value instilled in Anthony by his aristocratic upbringing, reflected in his life and career."</data>
